    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mysherryfitz.ie \nThis spacious modern home (Eircode R93 D9C3) is located in a quiet cul-de-sac convieniently perched on the edge of carlow town with good access to main roads, shops, schools and all town amentities.\nIt presents with 3 double bedrooms at 1st floor level with 2 supporting bathrooms. The entire has undergone a fixture and decorative upgrade in recent years to include a new composite hall door, quality bathroom fittings, a replacement kitchen, upgraded utility and new flooring throughout . It really is the quintessential \"turn key\" offering.\nExternally the low maintenance brick clad home offers parking to the front, a side gate and a generously proporstioned rear garden complete with steel storage shed"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.42 x 1.94\nComposite hall door with glazed panels.Laminate wooden floor.Carpeted stairs, wc/ utility beneath.\n\nUtility Room - 1.42 x 1.35\nBeneath stairs.Laminate wooden floors.Shelving.Plumbing.\n\nSitting Room - 5.65 x 3.90\nFeature bay window to front.Curtains, pole & blind.Laminate wooden floor.Solid Fuel Fireplace.Open arch to kitchen / dining area.\n\nKitchen - 5.98 x 3.47\nSliding patio and window to rear.Curtains and pole & blinds.Ceramic Tiles Floor.Recessed lighting.Fitted floor and wall units.Part tiled wallsWall mounted gas burner.Water softener unit installed to servcie the whole house\n\nLanding - 2.71 x 2.56\nLaminate wooden floor.Stira attic access. Attic is shelved & floored for additional storageHot press off.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.26 x 2.98\nDouble room.Windows to rear.Curtains, pole & blind.Laminate wooden floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.16 x 3.44\nDouble room.Windows to rear.Curtains, pole & blind.Built in Wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.06 x 3.87\nMaster room. Windows to front. Curtains, pole & blind.Laminate wooden floor.Built in wardrobe.Ensuite off\n\nEnsuite Off - 2.69 x0.78\nWindows to side.Ceramic tiled floor & walls.Toilet, vanity unit with sink, shower cubicle.Mirrored wall cabinet.Heated towel rail.\n\nBathroom - 2.05 x 1.96\nCeramic tiled floor & walls.Toilet, vanity unit with sink, bath.Mirror\n\n"
      },
      {
